Revision history for Logic-Relational

0.04	27 November 2026
	- Added in-process JSON-Datalog query interface
	- Added program introspection and schema auto-reflection via describe() method
	- Added predicate and program metadata registration
	- Extended Logic::Relational::Syntax with description, doc, program_version, and predicate declarations, plus describe, query_data, and query_json package exports
	- Added example of JSON-Datalog query interface

0.03	10 November 2026
	- Added detection of direct left-recursion and automatic tabling
	- Introduced sub-second precision timestamping via Time::HiRes for expiring facts, snapshot TTL calculations, and query goal expiration
	- Added max_steps and step_count to prevent unbounded recursion

0.02    12 October 2026
        - Added automatic ancestor cycle pruning (variant loop checking) on search states to prevent infinite recursion over cyclic graphs
        - Added subgoal tabling and iterative fixpoint answer memoization
        - Updated Logic::Relational::Syntax to add 'table' keyword and to fix parsing issues in facts { ... } blocks
        - Added distinct_values and all_tuples deduplication helpers for queries
        - Added some examples

0.01    1 September 2026
        - First version
        
